ENGINEERING NOTICE

The material property values distributed with this Software are datasheet
typicals collected from publicly published manufacturer documentation. They
are not design allowables and carry no warranty of fitness for any structural,
load-bearing, safety-critical, medical, automotive or aerospace application.

Printed part strength depends on wall count, infill, layer height, print
orientation, chamber temperature, moisture content and machine calibration,
none of which are captured by these values. Verify with physical testing
before relying on any figure here for a part that can cause harm if it fails.
